{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49546","headline":"拨櫂子 一 · 尹鹗","name":"拨櫂子 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风切切，深秋月。\n十朵芙蓉繁艳歇，小槛细腰无力。\n空赢得，目断魂飞何处说。\n寸心恰似丁香结，看看瘦尽胸前雪。\n偏挂恨，少年抛掷。\n羞覩见，绣被堆红闲不彻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"尹鹗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49546.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49546","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}